name=Lascivious Systems
id=LasciviousSystems
author=Dahaka
description=<H1> LASCIVIOUS SYSTEMS <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<TEXT> All-in-one server ecosystem: namespaced systems in one install, with explicit server-authoritative integrations, hardened persistence and reduced per-tick overhead. <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Lascivious Shop <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Multiplayer credit shop. Earn credits from zombie kills and survived hours, then spend them via /shop or the sidebar button. Curated catalog, progressive XP packages, rotating global offers, indexed smart search, server-authoritative pricing and delivery. <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Lascivious Factions System <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Server-authoritative factions with territory claims, respawn inside your own land, raid protection, ranks/permissions, diplomacy, friendly fire, chat, tags, leaderboard and optional Shop integrations. Built on an adapted bundled copy of PhunZones 2's zone engine (originally by UburGeek). <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Hardcore Kits <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Kit system via /kit or the sidebar: a random starter kit per character, a survival reward every 7 days, and configurable skill XP boosts. Large curated item pools, fully tunable through Sandbox Options. <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Loading Screen <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Also swaps the loading screen's progress sprites for a custom Lascivious logo. <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> LASCIVIOUS SYSTEMS (PT-BR) <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<TEXT> Ecossistema all-in-one para o servidor: sistemas com namespaces proprios numa unica instalacao, integracoes explicitas e autoritativas, persistencia reforcada e menos trabalho por tick. <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Lascivious Shop <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Loja de creditos multiplayer. Ganhe creditos abatendo zumbis e sobrevivendo horas, gaste pelo /shop ou pelo botao lateral. Catalogo selecionado, pacotes progressivos de XP, ofertas globais rotativas, busca inteligente indexada, precos e entregas controlados pelo servidor. <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Lascivious Factions System <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Faccoes com autoridade no servidor: territorio reivindicavel, respawn, protecao contra saque, cargos/permissoes, diplomacia, fogo amigo, chat, etiquetas, classificacao e integracoes opcionais com a Loja. Construido sobre uma copia adaptada e embutida do motor de zonas do PhunZones 2 (originalmente de UburGeek). <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Hardcore Kits <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Sistema de kits pelo /kit ou barra lateral: kit inicial aleatorio por personagem, recompensa de sobrevivencia a cada 7 dias, e bonus de XP configuraveis. Pools de itens grandes e curadas, totalmente ajustaveis pelas Opcoes de Sandbox. <LINE>
description=<BR>
description=<H1> Tela de Carregamento <LINE>
description=<TEXT> Tambem substitui os sprites de progresso da tela de loading por uma logo personalizada da Lascivious. <LINE>
